00:04:18.960 --> 00:04:26.640
a year later, Midjourney can do this. And I&nbsp;
would not be surprised if today we would be at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:26.640 --> 00:04:34.200
a DALL-E 1 moment for full film, or in other&nbsp;
words, video+audio generation. Just imagine&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:41.100
